<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT HAMPSHIRE BY AN INNINGS AND 133 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT HAMPSHIRE BY AN INNINGS AND 133 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHAMPTON, England 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat</p>
<p>Hampshire by an innings and 133 runs in their three-day cricket</p>
<p>match on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Hampshire 156 and 176. Australia 465-8 declared.</p>
</text>
